# Commit and push

When a task changes tracked files, commit and push that work on the current branch before the task is done. Do not wait to be asked.

- Leave out secrets: `*.p8`, `*.p12`, Play service-account JSON, `local.md`, and `mcp-shell.log`.
- Do not commit an empty tree. Do not update git config. Do not force-push.
- Use a short message that says why the change exists.
